      "Language": "por",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 52-year-old man with left atrial myxoma, in whom postoperative angiographic control revealed a coronary-cavitary fistula originated from a previous atrial branch from the circumflex coronary artery. These fistulas should be considered in cases of revascularized atrial myxoma."},
